e":"2025-02-13","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"MD"},{"bioguideId":"B001236","fullName":"Sen. Boozman, John [R-AR]","isOriginalCosponsor":true,"party":"R","sponsorshipDate":"2025-02-13","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"AR"},{"bioguideId":"C001056","fullName":"Sen. Cornyn, John [R-TX]","isOriginalCosponsor":true,"party":"R","sponsorshipDate":"2025-02-13","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"TX"},{"bioguideId":"H001079","fullName":"Sen. Hyde-Smith, Cindy [R-MS]","isOriginalCosponsor":true,"party":"R","sponsorshipDate":"2025-02-13","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"MS"},{"bioguideId":"B001303","fullName":"Sen. Blunt Rochester, Lisa [D-DE]","isOriginalCosponsor":true,"party":"D","sponsorshipDate":"2025-02-13","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"DE"},{"bioguideId":"P000145","fullName":"Sen. Padilla, Alex [D-CA]","isOriginalCosponsor":true,"party":"D","sponsorshipDate":"2025-02-13","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"CA"},{"bioguideId":"B001305","fullName":"Sen. Budd, Ted [R-NC]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"R","sponsorshipDate":"2025-03-13","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"NC"},{"bioguideId":"A000382","fullName":"Sen. Alsobrooks, Angela D. [D-MD]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"D","sponsorshipDate":"2025-04-28","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"MD"},{"bioguideId":"M001243","fullName":"Sen. McCormick, David [R-PA]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"R","sponsorshipDate":"2026-06-17","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"PA"}],"fetchedAt":"2026-09-17T05:35:52+00:00","id":"s574-119","introducedDate":"2025-02-13","latestAction":{"actionDate":"2025-02-13","text":"Read twice and referred to the Committee on Agriculture, Nutrition, and Forestry."},"laws":[],"number":"574","originChamber":"Senate","policyArea":"Agriculture and Food","sponsors":[{"bioguideId":"W000437","district":null,"fullName":"Sen. Wicker, Roger F. [R-MS]","party":"R","state":"MS"}],"summaries":[{"actionDate":"2025-02-13","actionDesc":"Introduced in Senate","text":"<p><strong>Healthy Poultry Assistance and Indemnification Act of 2025</strong></p><p>This bill expands the Animal and Plant Health Inspection Service (APHIS) producer indemnity and compensation program to include compensation for all poultry growers and layers located in an APHIS-determined control area, which may include non-infected poultry.</p><p>Currently, APHIS provides indemnity and compensation to producers to remove animals classified as affected, suspect, or exposed to diseases of concern, including highly pathogenic avian influenza (HPAI). An APHIS-determined&nbsp;<em>control area</em> consists of both an infected zone and a buffer zone. Under the bill, APHIS must compensate all owners of poultry growing or laying facilities within a control area, which may include facilities that are located in the buffer zones and have non-infected poultry.</p><p>Further, the bill establishes a new compensation payment formula that requires payments to be based on the owner’s average income from the five most recent flocks.</p>","updateDate":"2025-03-27T13:16:28Z","versionCode":"00"}],"title":"Healthy Poultry Assistance and Indemnification Act of 2025","type":"s","updateDate":"2026-06-18T15:25:22Z","updateDateIncludingText":"2026-06-18T15:25:22Z"}
